    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nCampbells Auctioneers are delighted to present this three-bedroom property to the open market, occupying a scenic coastal setting at Derrydruel, just outside Dungloe, Co. Donegal.\n\nSet on approximately 1.63 acres, the property enjoys an elevated position with beautiful sea views across the surrounding coastline and countryside.\n\nDerrydruel is a peaceful rural area while remaining within easy reach of Dungloe Town and its wide range of shops, schools, restaurants and other local amenities.\n\nInternally, the accommodation comprises an entrance hall, hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, utility room, three generously sized bedrooms, one of which benefits from en-suite facilities, together with a family bathroom and additional hall storage.\n\nExternally, the property is complemented by an old house, separate boiler house and a number of old stone ruins, adding considerable character to the grounds and reflecting the history of the property.\n\nThe generous 1.63-acre site, together with the existing buildings, old stone ruins and impressive sea views, creates a distinctive setting.\n\nViewing is by appointment with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\nOur Ref: 1271\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.87m (19'3\") x 1.95m (6'5\")\nTiled\n\nHallway - 5.38m (17'8\") x 1.09m (3'7\")\nTiled\n\nLiving Room - 5.07m (16'8\") x 4.02m (13'2\")\nHard Wood Floor\n\nKitchen / Dining - 5.05m (16'7\") x 4.14m (13'7\")\nTiled Floor & Splash back, Fully Fitted\n\nUtility Room - 2.32m (7'7\") x 1.95m (6'5\")\nTiled, Sink, Fitted Units, Back Door Entrace\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.49m (11'5\") x 3.47m (11'5\")\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.63m (11'11\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nFitted Wardrobe, Carpeted\n\nBedroom 3 (En Suite) - 3.62m (11'11\") x 3.48m (11'5\")\nFitted Wardrobe, Carpeted, En Suite\n\nEn Suite (Bed 3) - 2.78m (9'1\") x 1.17m (3'10\")\nFully Tiled, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nBathroom - 3.44m (11'3\") x 2.12m (6'11\")\nFully Tiled, Shower, Bath, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nHall Storage - 1.19m (3'11\") x 0.62m (2'0\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
